# python bytecode
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# ---- runtime scratch — all regenerated by a measurement run; NOT part of the committed deliverable ----
# routec_net_io OUT_DIR (per-run intermediate)
out/
# per-GPU-lane partial JSONs (gates_main_g0.json, gate5_cre_g1.json, ...); canonical MERGED JSONs are kept
results/*_g[0-9].json
# per-lane stdout / lane-split bookkeeping / quick-look figs (house-style deliverables live in figures/)
results/parallel_lane_gpu*.out
results/parallel_summary.json
results/*.out
results/*.log
results/*.png
results/*.svg

# Nested scientific-run logs are retained locally when useful but are not
# portable result artifacts.  The corresponding JSON records carry hardware,
# source hashes and checkpoint provenance.
results/**/*.log
repro_dm10_conductance_seed42/*.log
repro_dm10_conductance_seed42/console.log

# The experimental conductance retrain keeps only its final epoch-79 checkpoint
# in the handoff.  Earlier scheduled checkpoints are reproducible intermediates.
repro_dm10_conductance_seed42/ckpt_ep5_*.pt
repro_dm10_conductance_seed42/ckpt_ep30_*.pt
repro_dm10_conductance_seed42/ckpt_ep50_*.pt

# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# The COMMITTED deliverable KEEPS (none of the above patterns match these):
#   all *.py, README.md, CKPT_MD5.txt, .gitignore
#   checkpoint/*.pt                      — the 10 trained dm10 models (seeds 42-51, ep79, tau18)
#   fonts/Roboto-Regular.ttf             — house-style font
#   figures/*.{png,svg}                  — the 7 delivered validation figures
#   results/{gates_main,gate5_cre,gate6_latency_sweep}.json
#   results/gate7_cuerel_g1_seed*.json   results/gate7_cuerel_g1_aggregate.json
#   measure/  plots/  mechanism_influence/  records/
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
